##### MF9: MULTIPLICITIES FOR PRODUCTION OF RADIOACTIVE NUCLIDES  7525 1451
                                                                  7525 1451
All data are generated with Talys. Final states with a lifetime   7525 1451
that exceeds 1 second are treated as isomer.                      7525 1451
                                                                  7525 1451
